# Publish every curated run directory and every non-checkpoint artifact.
# The repository-level .gitignore explicitly exposes this good_runs tree.
!**/
!**

# Never publish interpreter or test caches copied with an analysis folder.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# Keep iteration checkpoints local by default, then explicitly publish only
# the numerically latest checkpoint from each curated training run.
**/model_*.pt

# Gitignore cannot select a numeric maximum dynamically. Add one exact
# exception here whenever a new curated run is archived.
